 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.工位状态与处理建议">Station state and next action</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.等待整机复位时的处理建议">The machine is waiting for reset. This is the machine state; it does not mean this station is moving. Confirm the emergency stop is released and every axis is stopped, then use Reset Alarms above. If start conditions remain unmet, follow the specific reason shown on the overview.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.存在停机报警时的复位建议">The machine is waiting for reset with a stop alarm active. Open Current Alarms for its source and recovery guidance. Reset only after the condition clears and the area is safe.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.启动条件未满足时的建议">The machine is reset, but Start is blocked by the following condition. Resolve it and check again:</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.正在检查启动条件时的建议">The system is checking axis, emergency stop and interlock readiness. Check the Start button again shortly.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.整机就绪时的处理建议">Start checks passed. Confirm the danger area is clear, then use Start above.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.整机运行时的处理建议">Automatic operation is in progress. Use Pause before intervening; this overview does not directly command axes or I/O.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.整机暂停时的处理建议">The machine is paused and retains its current steps. Check the equipment and workpieces, then reset and restart as required.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.整机报警时的处理建议">The machine is alarmed. Review the current alarm records and recovery guidance. Reset as required after the condition clears.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="操作页.整机报警但没有报警记录时的处理建议">The machine is alarmed, but no current alarm record is available. Refresh Current Alarms. If the mismatch remains, check the run log and contact maintenance.</sys:String>
